caption: Power Talent
tradition-component: power-talent

The Style fixes one existing advantage-based GATES Power Talent or college-equivalent Power Talent that can coherently function as a supernatural martial discipline. It grants that Talent and its normal advantage permissions, but no other Domain Core, resource, Tradition, or spellcasting framework.

Illegal Gaoshou Power Talents: Anti-Magic, Antipsi, Anti-Super, Body Alteration, Body Control, Chaos, Cosmic, Divine, Evil, Good, Magic, and Order. Body Control is represented by Cultivation; Body Alteration belongs to Transformation.
